{"message":"Based on the promotional offers I could verify, the EcoCard is the best match for your priority. New customers can earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking-account credit—after spending $5,000 on eligible purchases during the first month. The offer applies from 2025-08-01 through 2025-12-15, and the card has a $50 annual fee.

I found the other personal cards—Bronze Rewards Card, Silver Rewards Card, Gold Rewards Card, Platinum Rewards Card, Diamond Elite Card, Green Rewards Card, and Crypto-Cash Back Card—but I could not verify a current points or cash-back sign-up bonus for them from the available information. So EcoCard is the only confirmed promotional bonus and the strongest verifiable choice right now.

One important distinction: EcoCard earns sustainability points, while the other listed rewards cards generally provide cash back. If you expect to spend less than $5,000 in the first month, the bonus may be difficult to earn, and we should compare ongoing rewards and fees instead."}
